Why this architecture? Flutter lets you maintain Android and iOS from one mobile codebase. Next.js supports the customer website, seller portal, and admin panel. NestJS centralizes the business rules, while PostgreSQL stores the marketplace's main records.

Keep all services modular so the marketplace can grow without needing to rebuild everything.

